# ── Deploy-time credentials (DO NOT ship to server) ─────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.deploy and fill in. Sourced by deploy.sh.
# Auto-gitignored via the `.env*` rule.

# GitHub Container Registry token — used by deploy.sh ONLY to verify that the
# published image is private via the GitHub API. The server has its own docker
# login (one-time setup, see deploy.sh).
#
# Create at: https://github.com/settings/tokens/new
# Required scope (classic PAT): read:packages
# Or fine-grained: "Packages — Read"
GHCR_PAT=
